title: >-
  HIPPIE: A Generative Model for Electrophysiological Analysis Across Species,
  Technologies, and Modalities (benchmarking release)
message: >-
  An earlier preprint version of this work is available on bioRxiv (cited
  below); the manuscript currently associated with this code release is
  under peer review and not yet public. When the peer-reviewed version is
  published, this citation block will be updated to point at it.
